sequenceDiagram
    actor Alice
    participant Bob as Bob Johnson
    actor Charlie as Charlie<br/>Brown
    
    autonumber
    
    Alice->>Bob: Hello Bob!
    Note right of Bob: Bob is thinking
    Bob->>Charlie: Have you met Alice?
    Note over Alice,Charlie: Everyone is talking
    
    rect rgb(191, 223, 255)
        Alice->>Bob: How are you?
        Bob-->>Alice: Great!
    end
    
    loop Check status every hour
        Charlie->>Bob: Status check
        Bob-->>Charlie: All good
    end
    
    opt Extra response
        Bob-->>Alice: Thanks for asking!
    end
